From 754c53cb7f78185d69c991429ac4874b42d76dcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pipetto-crypto <pipetto-crypto@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:32:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] quartz: Move registration code to main.c

---
